                    elem_complexity:        `Navigating complexity — simulations, scenario work, systems and adaptive-leadership labs`,
                    seq_logical:            `Self-awareness first → collective work in the middle → complexity integration toward the end, each building on the last`,
                    seq_frontload:          `Front-load everything into one intensive offsite week, then leave them to it for 9 months`,
