                    coach_r4_measured:      `Manager-rated behaviour change, a re-test 360, project outcomes — measurement built into the design. Now I believe you can prove it at 9 months.`,
                    coach_r4_learning:      `A knowledge test measures what they can recite, not whether they lead differently. I'm buying behaviour and results, not learning-level scores.`,
